          </p>
          <a href="/whats-on" class="card-link">
            See events
            <svg
              width="14"
              height="14"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg
            >
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg
              width="22"
              height="22"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#0d1f3c"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Watch &amp; Listen</h3>
          <p>
            Catch up on recent sermons or join our live stream every Sunday morning at 10:30 am.
          </p>
          <a href="/watch-listen" class="card-link">
            Watch now
            <svg
              width="14"
              height="14"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg
            >
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg
              width="22"
              height="22"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#0d1f3c"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
              ><path
                d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>Our Mission</h3>
          <p>
            Christ centred and people focused — we're committed to serving Hinckley and sharing the
            love of Jesus.
          </p>
          <a href="/mission" class="card-link">
            Learn more
            <svg
              width="14"
              height="14"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
